WEBVTT

00:00:05.529 --> 00:00:11.529
Choose Home curation in the side menu.

00:00:15.558 --> 00:00:21.558
Check the Draft line beside the buttons.

00:00:25.857 --> 00:00:31.857
Scroll to Sections for the row.

00:00:34.949 --> 00:00:40.949
Click the Show New this week switch.

00:00:44.709 --> 00:00:50.709
Click Show New this week again to show it.

00:00:55.273 --> 00:01:01.273
Click Kids view in the live preview.

00:01:05.034 --> 00:01:11.034
Click Move New this week down.

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:19.990
Click Save draft.

00:01:21.591 --> 00:01:27.591
Click Publish changes.
